Package: com.securitylab.pikminauto
Name: Pikmin Auto
Version: 0.5.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Own-device Pikmin Bloom automation — silently numbers all Pikmin in pluck order, and offers toggles to auto-harvest flower petals, auto-collect expedition rewards, auto-feed nectar, and auto-send Pikmin on expeditions (not mushrooms) through the game own RPCs.
Author: security-lab
Maintainer: security-lab
Section: Development
Depends: ellekit
